From d9fad426921e4df0df3e8ee69fafcfa05c128568 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LeoDeadware <351117497+LeoDeadware@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:24:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/24] 60 fps: frame-time metric, HD preload, precise vblank,
 default 2.0x without SSAO
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

[ftime] per 10 s (flip / GPU / ready histograms) with RECOMP_FPS_LOG=1; HD pack decoded on a
background thread at start (no first-use PNG decode mid-race); vblank wait ends 1.5 ms early then
usleeps to the deadline; Metal default resolution scale 200 %, NFSU2_AO default 0 (owner 2026-11-07:
"залізні 60 fps").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
